WEBVTT

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:39.410
<b>Not from this sea, are you?</b>

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:48.080
Wow...

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:51.310
Welco-

00:01:56.620 --> 00:01:59.020
Whoa, she looks cool.

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:01.630
Eiko, go take her order.

00:02:01.630 --> 00:02:04.630
What? Where's Nagisa?

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:06.930
Oh right, she's got the late shift...

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:08.400
Think of it as a learning experience.

00:02:10.910 --> 00:02:14.750
Uhh, eat? Drink?

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:17.400
How... menu.. please?

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:27.500
I'd like an alien.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:28.120
Excuse me?!

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:35.260
I heard that one was sighted here.
Have you seen it?

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:38.610
I don't quite understand...

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:42.620
Oh, it's not an alien, but...

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:44.100
Huh?

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:48.870
Alien sighted!

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:52.710
I must take it to the lab and
start my analysis right away!

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:54.360
Now hold your seahorses!

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:56.760
What the squid is going on?

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:58.770
Who are you?!

00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:03.000
Oh, sorry. I haven't introduced myself yet.

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:07.740
I am one of the researchers of the
American Counter-Extraterrestrial Laboratory.

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:09.420
My name is Cindy Campbell.

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:13.420
I am traveling the world in order
to reveal the identity of aliens.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.380
You have too much time
on your tentacles.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:16.700
Who are you to say that?

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:21.040
Anyway, that's the story, so you
don't mind if I take it, right?

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:26.310
I do mind!
Stop talking like I'm an alien!

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:31.470
But the aliens I know also
have those things.

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:32.960
That's enough proof for me.

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:37.230
Does she even know anything
about aliens?

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.940
Anyway!

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:44.610
I am Squid Girl and I came here to
conquer the surface world!

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:46.200
Whatever, just get
off the counter.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:52.910
Conquer? That makes it rock-solid!
You are an alien!

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:55.580
Stop jumping to squidiotic
conclusions already!

00:03:56.260 --> 00:04:01.210
If you don't want to listen,
this ought to do the trick!

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:10.970
You see? Ten tentacles and squid ink...
Proof that I am a squid.

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:17.810
Powerful tentacles... a mysterious liquid...
this is the alien I've dreamt about.

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:21.240
She's so creepy!

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:28.740
Geez, humans are impossible!

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:36.130
Wait, I came to conquer,
not to clean up.

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:36.840
Here.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:38.840
Thank you!

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:42.550
Is this fuel for your UFO?
Or are you going to eat this?

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:44.420
She squidding followed me...

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:50.070
How about doing work instead
of fooling around here?

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:52.650
But I am working.

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:58.220
Quite important work actually:
communicating with aliens.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:07.470
I was born in that ocean!
I grew up in that ocean!

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:11.010
I came from that ocean in
order to conquer the surface world!

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:14.370
Stop treating me like
an alien already!

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:18.380
Do you have any proof that your
species was born on earth?

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:22.030
I mean even if you were
born in the ocean,

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:23.640
that alone doesn't prove that
you're a terran life form.

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:24.970
It's entirely possible
that your ancestors

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:28.770
came to earth a long time ago and
secretly created a base in the ocean,

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:30.680
where your kind evolved into a
half squid-half human entity

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:38.310
in order to be able to freely move around in
and out of the ocean. That would explain...

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:45.410
So, apparently I'm an alien.

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:49.790
Huh? Squid Girl, what got into
you all of the sudden?

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:52.430
I'd like to be addressed as
Squidian from now on.

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:53.830
So you're keeping the squid part?

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:57.960
I will show you proof
that I am a Squidian.

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:02.420
Because I am an alien,
I draw mystery circles.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:03.920
That's just a doodle.

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:06.760
Because I am an alien,
I will draw a geoglyph.

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:08.470
That's still just a doodle.

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:11.430
Where did you learn that?!

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:14.330
I am a mysterious...

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:15.390
Seriously, where?!

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:17.350
WE ARE...

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:20.080
Ow, I hit too squidly hard.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:23.070
Really, aliens don't talk like that.

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:28.050
Anyway, from today on,
you are to treat me as an alien.

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:30.570
Well, if that's what you want...

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:34.030
So, Squid Girl cum Squidian!

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:37.570
Take these dishes to the
table in the left corner.

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:38.500
Roger.

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:42.340
Squidian Girlie, let's play!

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:44.910
Takeru, you'll have to wait.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.970
This is exactly the same as before!

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:52.030
I demand to be treated
like an alien!

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:53.500
What does that even mean?

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:56.390
This smell...

00:06:57.110 --> 00:06:58.390
Shrimp?!

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:00.820
Here you go, Squidian.

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:03.400
This looks tasty. Can I eat it?!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:04.760
Of course!

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:09.350
Oh, but Squidian, you're
an alien, aren't you?

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:10.520
Hm...

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.240
I wonder if Squidians eat shrimp.

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:22.580
Never heard of that.
Takeru, what about you?

00:07:23.050 --> 00:07:27.770
I heard that aliens abduct cows
and pigs and suck their blood.

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:29.550
Ew, that sounds gross.

00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:34.890
Yeah. They might eat cattle,
but definitely no shrimp.

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:41.270
If you're not going to eat it,
I'll have it so we don't waste it.

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:43.070
Thanks!

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:46.150
What are you doing?
You're an alien!

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:51.150
What are you talking about?
I am Squid Girl.

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:52.790
Say what now?

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:55.230
Damn, looks like my brainwashing
was a little too light.

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:59.700
Excuse me, but I can't
let you take Squiddie.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:04.570
Even if she were an
alien, right, Eiko?

00:08:04.570 --> 00:08:07.320
Yeah, you can't take her.

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:10.550
Eiko...

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:14.220
Squid Girl is our valuable servant!

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:16.090
I have no squidly friends...

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:21.240
Besides, even if you were to examine this one,
you'd only get some squid ink.

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:24.730
All right, I will leave for now.

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:27.880
But I will never give up.

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:32.450
I will keep coming until you
admit that you're an alien.

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:49.590
Okay!

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:54.430
Hey, Squid Girl.

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:58.230
Take care of the store,
I'll be back around lunch.

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:01.190
Where are you going in
that cosplay getup?

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:02.880
It's not cosplay!

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:06.900
Today's a school day,
so I'm wearing school clothes.

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:09.160
School?

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:12.500
I'm going, too!

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:15.210
Has your ink gone to your brain?
You can't come!

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:18.780
Who knows what'll happen if
you use those tentacles at school!

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:21.980
That would be even worse
than Nagisa...

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:27.350
So the humans would be terrified
and run around in panic?

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:31.210
Anyway, you have to work hard
to cover my part, too!

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:36.000
It's not fair that you get
to have fun alone!

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:40.510
Let's do our best today, huh?

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:41.860
I'm off.

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:43.490
Bye bye!

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:49.460
<b>Why not join the school of fish?</b>

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:01.750
So you left her? I mean Squiddie?

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:06.200
Of course, I can't babysit
her in a place like this.

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:11.600
Oh man. I even brought her a
special sailor school uniform.

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:13.760
What DO you come to school for?

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:16.120
Good morning, long time no see.

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:17.500
Morning.

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:22.560
I get to see everybody after
so long, I won't let her ruin-

00:10:23.940 --> 00:10:25.950
That bastard...

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:27.170
What's wrong?

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:30.230
Damn, I have no choice
but to wait.

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:39.910
Upon closer inspection, everybody
is wearing the same clothes.

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:42.450
Could this be a military base?

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:46.910
It was good that I got away from
Chizuru in order to scout this place out.

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:50.250
Ah! What?

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:55.880
This room is...

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:59.390
full of suspicious equipment
for experiments.

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:05.890
I bet they develop chemical
weapons here.

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:08.890
Ow, I'm squidly sor-

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:16.070
Th-They even run experiments
on the body!

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:18.530
What a terrifying place.

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:26.240
This is the hacking room.

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:29.540
This is where they prepare
the combat rations.

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:32.250
This is the training room.

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.580
This is the briefing room.

00:11:36.390 --> 00:11:39.420
High security. Must be
the weapons locker.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:43.680
This is where they treat
the wounded.

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:47.490
This facility is more put together
than I thought.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:51.010
Darn those humans.
I can't underestimate them.

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:54.310
Principal's Office

00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:54.020
What's this?

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:59.230
Independence

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:59.230
Wow, this is the only room that's
strangely nice and spacious.

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:02.070
A trophy for victory!

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:05.620
I will serve the heads of
my enemies on this!

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:20.710
From today forth, I will be the
Supreme Squid of this place!

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:24.210
Anybody who opposes me will
get the death sentence!

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:36.970
And who are you?

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:39.760
Wh-Who the squid are YOU?!

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:41.190
Well, I mean...

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:45.400
Since you came to this room,
I guess you're the ruler of this place.

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:50.910
I suppose you could
put it that way.

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:56.710
Which means that I will be the
top squid here if I defeat this guy.

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:59.840
Anyway, you can't just
come in here.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.960
It's not an issue!

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:05.930
After all, this place will be
squidly mine from today on!

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:13.920
All right, that's it for today.
The next school day will be...

00:13:17.090 --> 00:13:22.040
Foolish humans, I have
conquered this place.

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:23.330
Squiddie!

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:24.150
Damn her!

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:26.910
I will rule this place from now on.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:31.280
If you oppose me, you forfeit
the life of the previous ruler.

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:34.080
Hm, this is not good.

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:38.370
You will be my trusty soldiers
and scatter across the land

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:41.040
to conquer the surface
world for me!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:44.120
Squiddie will be the
ruler of the school.

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:45.030
Hey.

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:47.460
And I will be her bodyguard!

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:48.260
Hey!

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:54.560
When I've conquered the entire
surface world, then...

00:13:54.560 --> 00:14:02.470
then I will rule everything...
and rule and conquer and subjugate...

00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:06.820
and eat all the shrimp I want every day!

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:08.320
Shrimp?

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:13.150
Yes. As tempura, fried, as sashimi...

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:18.240
If you obey me, I'll let you
eat a little bit, too.

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:23.090
I actually have a shrimp allergy,
so I can't have any shellfish.

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:28.550
What? You can't eat shrimp?!
What joy do you have in life?!

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:32.970
Stop resisting!

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:36.720
Open your mouth!

00:14:36.900 --> 00:14:39.310
Are you squidly saying my
shrimp is not good enough?!

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:44.480
Cut it out already!

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:48.530
Geez.

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:52.950
I'm sorry about that.

00:14:53.630 --> 00:14:56.120
I don't understand
today's students.

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:04.420
You could have told me that it's a
place where you squidly study.

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:07.670
You just randomly ran amok.

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:17.520
Eiko! I want to go to school, too.

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:21.230
You'll have to start
with grade school.

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:47.690
<b>Wouldn't having a pet be squidtastic?</b>

00:17:44.610 --> 00:17:46.320
Squii...

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:36.230
Squii!

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:40.580
Squii! Squii!

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:47.960
Squii! Squii!

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:56.480
Squii! Squii!

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:32.850
Squii, squii.

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:34.400
Squii!

00:21:29.590 --> 00:21:30.810
Squii?

00:21:32.610 --> 00:21:36.450
The life expectancy of a mini
Squid Girl is about 150 years,

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:40.230
thus they live much longer
than humans.

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:43.040
Squii?

00:22:02.180 --> 00:22:03.920
That's the dream I had.

00:22:04.310 --> 00:22:07.120
Why am I not the one
with Squiddie?!

00:22:07.120 --> 00:22:08.250
That's mean!

00:22:08.250 --> 00:22:09.890
So sue me.

00:23:41.830 --> 00:23:44.460
My name is Nagatsuki Sanae
and I love Squiddie.

00:23:44.460 --> 00:23:45.110
Next time:

00:23:45.110 --> 00:23:46.650
Up for an inkredible Hero Stage Show?

00:23:46.650 --> 00:23:48.230
Squidn't you be studying right now?

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:49.460
Is this inkfatuation or love?

00:23:49.460 --> 00:23:51.200
All three!

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:54.020
Watch and support Squiddie and I!
